SOUND | soft | close_win | blip | wave=triangle f0=784 f1=392 dur=0.12 attack=0.002 decay=0.09 vol=0.3 | a window closed
SOUND | soft | refused | blip | wave=square f0=180 dur=0.09 attack=0.002 decay=0.068 vol=0.3 lp=900 | nothing to do / blocked
SOUND | soft | toggle_on | blip | wave=sine f0=600 f1=800 dur=0.06 attack=0.002 decay=0.045 vol=0.3 | a switch turned on
SOUND | soft | toggle_off | blip | wave=sine f0=800 f1=600 dur=0.06 attack=0.002 decay=0.045 vol=0.3 | a switch turned off
SOUND | soft | startup | notes | tempo=168 seq=C5:0.25,E5:0.25,G5:0.25,B5:0.25,D6:0.25,E6:0.25,G6:0.25,B6:0.25,C7:2 seq2=G6:0.25,E6:0.25,D6:0.25,B5:0.25,G5:0.25,E5:0.25,C5:0.25,G4:0.25,C5:2 seq3=C3:4 wave=triangle wave2=sine wave3=sine gain3=0.8 vol=0.065 attack=0.003 decay=0.25 tail=1 shimmer=0.5 echo=180,0.5,0.5 reverb=0.35 fade=0.8 | LyfeDesk coming up: a fast arpeggio in two voices in contrary motion over a low C, then a shimmering echo and a trail-off (chime half of startup option C; the spoken half is a later step)
